n HIER abbonieren.<br />\n</strong></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Unterstuetzen kann man den Podcast bei <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/retrokompott?ty=h\">PATREON</a><br />\n</span></span></p>\n<hr />\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><br />\nDie Links und weiterfuehrenden Infos zum Podcast:</span></strong></p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid23\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"> </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid34\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/o0TE927j4cs\" target=\"_blank\">The Story of Ocean Software</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid35\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid39\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">1982 </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid40\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">ET</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid41\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid42\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">1983 </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid43\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">James Bond 007 Parker Bros </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid44\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Buck Rogers &#8211; Planet of Zoom</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid45\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Godzilla </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid46\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Wargames </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid47\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid49\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">1984</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid50\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Conan</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid51\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Dallas Quest</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid52\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Ein Colt fuer alle Faelle (The Fall guy)</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid53\" class=\"\"><span class=\"aut